Optional plugin gps-zone (copybot-plugin/copybot-plugin-gps-zone)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Time zone boundary data
  Contains the time zone boundaries of Timezone Boundary Builder
  (https://github.com/evansiroky/timezone-boundary-builder), built from
  OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors.
  The data is made available under the Open Data Commons Open Database License
  (ODbL) v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  It is embedded, unmodified, in the timeshape library below (data.tar.zstd).

timeshape 2026b.29 (net.iakovlev:timeshape), https://github.com/RomanIakovlev/timeshape
  Code under the MIT License; its time zone data under the ODbL (above).

